  "statement": "实现solve(n)，返回从1到n（含n）的所有整数之和。n=0返回0。",
  "input_contract": "一个整数n，0<=n<=8；布尔值不属于合法整数。",
  "source": "def solve(n):\n    s = 0\n    for i in range(1, n):\n        s += i\n    return s\n",
